{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "GLACE — Sentinel-1 composites (2022)",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Every published web-map layer of one year. The first is visible and the rest ship hidden, so a client switches by visibility rather than by loading another style. Each archive holds value codes, decoded by its raster-dem source's custom encoding and drawn by a color-relief layer over a default ramp a client may replace. Rendered from metadata/assets.yaml."
